<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates close lower on dull demand.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates close lower on dull demand.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed lower on Monday on dull demand from yarn-users, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates are likely to ease in the current week, one dealer said.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts: Monday April 10</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     470	   480</p>
<p>    Suraiya Textile	    445	   455</p>
<p>    Popular			455	   465</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
